  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Javan Rhino Protection Units in Ujung Kulon National Park, Java, Indonesia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to, (1) Patrol and survey the full extent of Ujung Kulon National Park (UKNP), (2) Monitor rhino and threatened wildlife populations, (3) Curtail hunting and trapping of wildlife, and, (4) Minimize effects of human encroachment.</narrative>
  </description>
